<title>JAPAN: Qatar raises crude price formula for Oct - traders.</title>
<headline>Qatar raises crude price formula for Oct - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatar General Petroleum Corp (QGPC) has raised its price formula for Qatar Land crude oil by six cents per barrel and Qatar Marine by seven cents per barrel for October, traders in Tokyo said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
